    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132930/extras/b5e2e571ace5e5307464ecf49ab78a4f.poster.avif?t=1753439515\" width=612 height=158 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132930/extras/b5e2e571ace5e5307464ecf49ab78a4f.webm?t=1753439515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132930/extras/b5e2e571ace5e5307464ecf49ab78a4f.mp4?t=1753439515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Set sail for adventure in this new installment of the award-winning Monument Valley game series, exploring an expansive and beautiful world of puzzles.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Begin a thrilling new voyage into an enchanting puzzle world. Guide Noor, a young apprentice, through a world of shifting architecture and rising tides as she seeks to restore the fading light.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEFY PERSPECTIVE TO SOLVE PUZZLES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twist gravity. Shift perspectives. Reshape ancient structures. Every puzzle is a new challenge in logic, intuition, and imagination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132930/extras/ce2d4b108b1fe61c8f89cd529265cc09.poster.avif?t=1753439515\" width=782 height=508 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132930/extras/ce2d4b108b1fe61c8f89cd529265cc09.webm?t=1753439515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132930/extras/ce2d4b108b1fe61c8f89cd529265cc09.mp4?t=1753439515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CHANGE THE WORLD AS YOU EXPLORE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From serene temples to crumbling ruins, journey through mesmerising environments bursting with colour, mystery, and meaning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132930/extras/ab60521c8f712549be0c1f4889c38ae9.poster.avif?t=1753439515\" width=782 height=508 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132930/extras/ab60521c8f712549be0c1f4889c38ae9.webm?t=1753439515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132930/extras/ab60521c8f712549be0c1f4889c38ae9.mp4?t=1753439515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SET SAIL THROUGH RISING TIDES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate across shifting seas. Your boat companion is the key to unlocking long-lost secrets and hidden paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132930/extras/111fe4797d2d324027295c396498155d.poster.avif?t=1753439515\" width=782 height=508 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132930/extras/111fe4797d2d324027295c396498155d.webm?t=1753439515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132930/extras/111fe4797d2d324027295c396498155d.mp4?t=1753439515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE COMPLETE EXPERIENCE \u2014 WITH MORE TO COME</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monument Valley 3 includes the full story at launch, with additional puzzles and chapters arriving post-release.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132930/extras/7e506471a46234180a5cf44faa06996a.poster.avif?t=1753439515\" width=638 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132930/extras/7e506471a46234180a5cf44faa06996a.webm?t=1753439515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132930/extras/7e506471a46234180a5cf44faa06996a.mp4?t=1753439515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>\u2022 Solve mind-bending puzzles across breathtaking spaces   <br>\u2022 Discover new environments shaped by illusion and perspective   <br>\u2022 Experience a rich, emotional journey through impossible geometry and sacred light   <br>\u2022 Includes all future updates and content at no extra cost.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Add to your wishlist to be the first to continue Noor\u2019s journey as new chapters unfold.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ustwo games are proud independent developers, best known for the award-winning Monument Valley series, Land\u2019s End, Assemble with Care, and Alba: A Wildlife Adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132930/extras/b5e2e571ace5e5307464ecf49ab78a4f.poster.avif?t=1753439515\" width=612 height=158 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132930/extras/b5e2e571ace5e5307464ecf49ab78a4f.webm?t=1753439515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132930/extras/b5e2e571ace5e5307464ecf49ab78a4f.mp4?t=1753439515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Set sail for adventure in this new installment of the award-winning Monument Valley game series, exploring an expansive and beautiful world of puzzles.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Begin a thrilling new voyage into an enchanting puzzle world. Guide Noor, a young apprentice, through a world of shifting architecture and rising tides as she seeks to restore the fading light.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEFY PERSPECTIVE TO SOLVE PUZZLES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twist gravity. Shift perspectives. Reshape ancient structures. Every puzzle is a new challenge in logic, intuition, and imagination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132930/extras/ce2d4b108b1fe61c8f89cd529265cc09.poster.avif?t=1753439515\" width=782 height=508 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132930/extras/ce2d4b108b1fe61c8f89cd529265cc09.webm?t=1753439515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_as