class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE COMPLETE EXPERIENCE \u2014 WITH MORE TO COME</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monument Valley 3 includes the full story at launch, with additional puzzles and chapters arriving post-release.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132930/extras/7e506471a46234180a5cf44faa06996a.poster.avif?t=1753439515\" width=638 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132930/extras/7e506471a46234180a5cf44faa06996a.webm?t=1753439515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132930/extras/7e506471a46234180a5cf44faa06996a.mp4?t=1753439515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>\u2022 Solve mind-bending puzzles across breathtaking spaces   <br>\u2022 Discover new environments shaped by illusion and perspective   <br>\u2022 Experience a rich, emotional journey through impossible geometry and sacred light   <br>\u2022 Includes all future updates and content at no extra cost.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Add to your wishlist to be the first to continue Noor\u2019s journey as new chapters unfold.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ustwo games are proud independent developers, best known for the award-winning Monument Valley series, Land\u2019s End, Assemble with Care, and Alba: A Wildlife Adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
